{
  "_comment": [
    "Every locator YouTube Studio automation depends on, in one file, so that",
    "healing a UI change is a patch here rather than a hunt through code.",
    "",
    "Each entry: primary locator, ordered fallbacks, and a plain-English",
    "'expect' used in drift reports. Prefer role+name over css \u2014 Studio's class",
    "names are minified and rotate on deploy, its ARIA roles do not.",
    "",
    "'verified' records whether the locator has actually been resolved against",
    "a live page by canary.py. Unverified entries are guesses and must not be",
    "trusted silently."
  ],
